  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into 0.5cm-thick rounds.\n• Place potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with savoury seasoning and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast until golden, 20 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6835130ed9848b9dac04c0dd/step-b1073200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop silverbeet and brown onion.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice double cream brie.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6835130ed9848b9dac04c0dd/step-50140910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook silverbeet and onion, stirring, until tender, 3-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6835130ed9848b9dac04c0dd/step-2ea02f20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Evenly stack 5 sheets of filo pastry with a drizzle of olive oil between each layer and place on a second lined oven tray.\n• Top with roasted potatoes, leaving a 4cm border around the edge.\n• Top with sliverbeet-onion mixture and brie slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6835130ed9848b9dac04c0dd/step-cb579d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Carefully fold pastry edges over filling, leaving the centre exposed.\n• Bake galette until golden, 15-20 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Add rocket leaves and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6835130ed9848b9dac04c0dd/step-232be640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy brie and silverbeet filo galette between plates.\n• Top with rocket.\n• Serve with tomato relish. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6835130ed9848b9dac04c0dd/step-e89ef450.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
